      "text": "```\nTLS 1.3 OVERVIEW:\n  RFC 8446; 1-RTT full handshake; 0-RTT resumption; AEAD-only; no static RSA\n  Always forward-secret: ephemeral (EC)DHE required; no static DH or RSA key exchange\n  Removed from TLS 1.3: RSA key exchange, CBC+HMAC suites, RC4, 3DES, SHA-1, MD5, NULL"
    },
    {
      "id": "03-PROTOCOLS.md#008",
      "path": [
        "03-PROTOCOLS.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
