        "root_concepts": "[protocols]",
        "section": "cryptography",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "03 - Cryptographic Protocols",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "ClientHello:\n    client_random (32 bytes)\n    legacy_session_id (for middlebox compat; ignored in TLS 1.3)\n    cipher_suites: TLS_AES_128_GCM_SHA256, TLS_AES_256_GCM_SHA384,\n                   TLS_CHACHA20_POLY1305_SHA256\n    extensions:\n      supported_versions: [TLS 1.3, TLS 1.2]  (TLS 1.3 indicated here)\n      key_share: [(X25519, client_ec_pub), (P-256, ...)]\n      supported_groups: X25519, P-256, X448, P-384\n      signature_algorithms: ecdsa_secp256r1_sha256, ed25519, rsa_pss_rsae_sha256, ...\n      server_name: \"example.com\"  (SNI — Server Name Indication)\n      early_data (optional for 0-RTT)"
    },
    {
      "id": "03-PROTOCOLS.md#010",
      "path": [
        "03-PROTOCOLS.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[proof-backfill:cryptography:03-protocols, git-history:cryptography:03-protocols]",
        "canonical_path": "cryptography/03-PROTOCOLS.md",
