        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "03 - Cryptographic Protocols",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "ServerHello:\n    server_random (32 bytes)\n    cipher_suite: TLS_AES_128_GCM_SHA256\n    extensions:\n      supported_versions: TLS 1.3\n      key_share: (X25519, server_ec_pub)   ← ephemeral key pair generated per handshake"
    },
